{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ellentis is a strategic card game set in a unique world of five elements. Simple rules hide a depth of gameplay, where every decision matters. Create combinations, manage your hand and maximize points by arranging cards in a circle on the board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Each card</u></strong> in the game has parameters such as:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Color</strong> - red, yellow, green, blue, brown </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rank</strong> - 1, 2, 3, 4, 5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Material</strong> - Each of the 13 materials provides unique mechanics during the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Essence</strong> - The degree of essence of a card affects the score of the arrangement in the circle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Circle mechanics</strong> - cards are placed in 5 slots in a circle on the board, and then all created arrangements are scored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slot upgrade mechanics</strong> - Each slot in the circle can be upgraded to provide an additional effect. Use this opportunity on your way to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special Powers</strong> - You'll be able to use 3 special powers of your choice during the game, which you'll use at critical moments to succeed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different deck types</strong> - Each deck is a new way to play the game to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievement System</strong> - For each achievement you earn in the game, you unlock new content: new decks, card materials, slot upgrades, and special powers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to learn, hard to master</strong> - every game is a new challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with combinations, plan your moves, and discover how far you can go in the world of <strong>Ellentis</strong>!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Power of Three","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3586740/bfd0ccf2ab0eb5ab534d072f9a1979423e4d01bc.jpg"},{"name":"Tetralogy of Color","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3586740/914867cfd52b59171ff1add5d1b83d8526ccec11.jpg"},{"name":"Absolute Unity","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3586740/b6cd64531603c955bcfe3672caa8ee43a1b6db97.jpg"},{"name":"Iron Formation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3586740/e6a12d47f9d7d9625d254aa923d3887be724a9dc.jpg"},{"name":"Master of Purchase","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3586740/a8cd4c78a0c518c0c98b15a47c593815758e6981.jpg"},{"name":"Archmage of Tactics","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3586740/24a4e8e3cbdaba979284fb0f5e44e97513e399ab.jpg"},{"name":"Wanderer of Destiny","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3586740/4ea069b2252306bf9a07f5e1e5f6ebf5b8bb355b.jpg"},{"name":"First Step into the Unknown","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3586740/2ebb43e1cd2524fed05b7c5eee5725966d8947c7.jpg"},{"name":"Emerald Power","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3586740/5f5e26db1763afc4894e86edbec00385436dfea9.jpg"},{"name":"Gentleman of Light","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3586740/ca7a153e9701ad32c09fd411a9a2ffb9f8e4d4eb.jpg"}],"total":80},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3586740?t=1761308965","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586740