ics</strong> - Each slot in the circle can be upgraded to provide an additional effect. Use this opportunity on your way to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special Powers</strong> - You'll be able to use 3 special powers of your choice during the game, which you'll use at critical moments to succeed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Different deck types</strong> - Each deck is a new way to play the game to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievement System</strong> - For each achievement you earn in the game, you unlock new content: new decks, card materials, slot upgrades, and special powers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to learn, hard to master</strong> - every game is a new challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with combinations, plan your moves, and discover how far you can go in the world of <strong>Ellentis</strong>!</p>","developers":["Kielan xD"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586740/41172370515dc4f6f2b0372a7a06bf7258b2f38f/header.jpg?t=1761308965","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright by Dominik Kielanowicz \"KIelan xD\". All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04 / Debian 11 / Arch Linux or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.4 GHz Dual Core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GPU with 512MB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1000 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04 / Debian 11 / Arch Linux or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>